        "slideId": "s4",
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Production data platforms rest upon six architectural pillars. Pillar 1 is Content-Addressable Data Version Control using DVC or LakeFS, binding code commits to SHA-256 dataset digests. Pillar 2 is Declarative Pipeline Reproducibility via directed acyclic graphs that cache deterministic stages.",
