        "slide": 8,
        "slideId": "s8",
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "As summarized in Table 1.9 of our monograph, legal statutes impose concrete software architecture requirements onto dataset pipelines. Under the European Union's GDPR, personal data requires purpose limitation and triggers Article 17 Right to Erasure, impacting immutable Parquet archives.",
