        "text": "Time for Active Checkpoint 2. Let us test your mathematical precision in designing a distributed URL frontier. A web crawling frontier must track n equals 10,000,000 unique visited URLs. The engineering specification demands a false positive probability p-sub-fp less than or equal to 1.0 percent. How many megabytes of RAM must be allocated for the Bloom filter bit array, and how many hash functions k-star should be configured? Select Option A, B, C, or D.",
