        "text": "Checkpoint 2 time! Nova, ProPublica claimed COMPAS was racially biased because of disparate false positive rates, while Northpointe insisted COMPAS was fair because risk scores were perfectly calibrated across races. Who was right?",
        "start": 617.496,
