        "text": "Welcome to Slide 6: our first interactive simulator. This is the Industrial Ingestion Quality Cost Cascade Workbench. Here, you can adjust monthly ingestion volume, per-stage defect rates, upstream validation costs, warehouse cleaning costs, and downstream billing failure costs. Notice how the economic balance shifts. When you permit even a twenty percent defect leakage into downstream production, the catastrophic billing repair costs surge into tens of thousands of dollars. Upstream pre-ingestion validation halts corrupted records before they enter your data warehouse, securing over twenty-eight times return on investment.",
