        "text": "Notice two critical engineering traps. First, 'Sale' includes non-monetary valuable consideration such as discounted ad analytics, while CPRA's 'Sharing' strictly covers cross-context behavioral advertising—meaning programmatic IDFA or GAID ad exchanges trigger mandatory opt-outs and frictionless browser Sec-GPC: 1 header enforcement. Second, unlike GDPR or HIPAA, Section 1798.150 grants consumers a direct private right of action awarding one hundred to seven hundred fifty dollars per breached victim without proving pecuniary loss.",
