        "slideId": "s9",
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Constitutional AI replaces human exposure with a two-phase architecture: Phase 1 uses Critique-and-Revision prompting against a written constitution of principles to generate safe supervised training data. Phase 2 uses an automated judge model evaluating candidate pairs against these principles to train an RLAIF preference model, matching human quality while eliminating worker trauma.",
