            "text": "Because in anomaly detection, cybersecurity intrusion, and high-value fraud, the extreme outlier IS the very signal we are trying to predict! If a corporate fraudster drains 500,000 dollars while normal buyers spend 45 dollars, blindly dropping top outliers throws away every fraud example in your training split!",
            "dock": "main",
